# Build context of apps/server/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (RF-C3).
# The `**/` forms are mandatory: in .dockerignore a bare `.env` only matches the root of the
# context, so `apps/server/.env` would end up in a builder layer and in the buildx cache.
# scripts/check-compose.mjs checks these entries; scripts/check-dockerignore.sh proves them.
# Never add a `<name>.Dockerfile.dockerignore` next to a Dockerfile: BuildKit prefers it over this one.

# Secrets and private material
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
private/
content/_local/
infra/local.secrets.env

# VCS and agent files
.git
.claude/

# Build outputs, dependencies and generated code (rebuilt inside the image)
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
apps/web/build
apps/web/test-results
apps/web/src/lib/paraglide

# Not needed by any image
docs/
# Local tools (the SFF converter may hold MUGEN input next to it; 002 plan-b decision 16)
tools/
